# DataHub's Claude skills, vendored by `npx skills add datahub-project/datahub-skills`.
# Not committed: ~2MB of third-party files that ship without a bundled license. Our own
# skill *outputs* live in skill_docs/ and ARE committed, which is what DataHub asks
# contributors for.
/.agents/
/.claude/
skills-lock.json

# Local, maintainer-only notes: agent instructions and the runbook for verifying against
# Qualytics' own deployments. Claude Code loads CLAUDE.local.md automatically.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# Local ingestion runs and anything captured from a live tenant that has not been
# sanitized yet. Sanitized fixtures belong in tests/fixtures/ and ARE committed.
/scratch/
*.local.yml
*.local.json
generated_output/
